v 2.1.0
d 'scpc': High-Performance Spatial Correlation Robust Inference via SCPC.
d
d This Stata package implements the (Conditional-) Spatial Correlation Principle Components 
d (C-SCPC) method of Müller and Watson (2022, 2023) for the construction of confidence 
d intervals that account for many forms of spatial correlation.
d Accelerated with pure-Mata routines (2x-5x speedup), 64-point Gauss-Legendre quadrature,
d Brent root-finding, vectorized PRNG sampling, and unconditional critical value caching.
d
d KW: spatial correlation
d KW: HAC
d KW: t-statistic
d 
d Requires: Stata version 13
d
d Distribution Date: 20261110
d
d Original Authors: Ulrich K. Müller & Mark W. Watson
d Optimization & Modernization: Paul David Boll & Antigravity
d
d Support: https://github.com/spatial-spur/scpc-stata
d
F scpc.ado
F scpc.sthlp
